FAQs:

Q: Do you provide sensors?
A: We partner with the world's leading IoT manufacturers to provide the best hardware for your specific needs.

Q: How long do sensors last?
A: Our low-power sensors can run for 3-5 years on a single internal battery.

Q: What if there is no signal?
A: Our sensors store data locally and "burst" it to the cloud as soon as a connection is found.

Q: How precise is the GPS?
A: We provide precision within 2 meters globally using GPS and GLONASS satellites.

Q: Does it work with SAP?
A: Yes, we provide a unified API to feed logistics data directly into your SAP or Oracle system.

Q: What is the ROI?
A: Most clients pay for the system through fuel savings and reduced cargo loss within 6-9 months.

Q: Can my customers see it?
A: Yes, you can create "Public Tracking Links" to share with your customers for their specific orders.

Q: Can we track 10,000 items?
A: Our backend uses high-throughput event processing and can handle millions of sensors simultaneously.

